<section id="about" data-animate data-animate-delay="2">
  <SectionHeading title="About" />
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
    I'm a final-year CS student at NTU (GPA 3.98/4.3). Since Sep 2024, I've been an undergraduate
    researcher in ElsaLab under Prof. Chun-Yi Lee at NTU CSIE, where most of my work on
    high-performance and LLM-inference systems — quantization, kernel fusion, distributed
    training/inference, and diffusion-model decoding — takes shape before it turns into
    competition results or papers, from a 777x speedup on an exascale climate emulator to an
    overall win at the SC25 Student Cluster Competition. I'm applying to MSCS programs to keep
    pushing on the systems side of AI.
  </p>
</section>
